@bookism_HostAddress = http://localhost:5164

### 1. Health Checks - Live (tidak menyentuh dependency)
GET {{bookism_HostAddress}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

### 2. Health Checks - Ready (cek database & redis readiness)
GET {{bookism_HostAddress}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### 3. Health Checks - Dependencies (cek detail dependency)
GET {{bookism_HostAddress}}/health/dependencies
Accept: application/json

### 4. Register - Format Validasi Gagal (422 Unprocessable Entity)
POST {{bookism_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "ab",
  "email": "invalid-email-format",
  "password": "123",
  "confirmPassword": "456"
}

### 5. Register - Sukses Akun User Baru (200 OK via EF Core)
POST {{bookism_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "reader_john",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "confirmPassword": "Password123!"
}

### 6. Login - Administrator (Dapper Read + Pre-warm Cache User)
POST {{bookism_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "brandnewshvt",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 7. Session Introspection - Get Current User (Cache Hit via users:{id})
GET {{bookism_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json

### 8. Get Books - Paginated & Relational Join (Cache Miss -> DB -> Cache Set)
GET {{bookism_HostAddress}}/api/books?page=1&limit=5
Accept: application/json

### 9. Get Books - Panggilan Kedua (Cache Hit -> Cepat sub-milidetik dari Redis/RAM)
GET {{bookism_HostAddress}}/api/books?page=1&limit=5
Accept: application/json

### 10. Get Book By ID - Detail Buku (Cache-Aside books:1)
GET {{bookism_HostAddress}}/api/books/1
Accept: application/json

### 11. Create Book - Mutasi Admin (EF Core Write -> Invalidate Cache books:list:*)
POST {{bookism_HostAddress}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Designing Data-Intensive Applications",
  "summary": "The big ideas behind reliable, scalable, and maintainable systems.",
  "language": "English",
  "isbn10": "1449373321",
  "isbn13": "978-1449373320",
  "totalPages": 616,
  "releaseDate": 2017,
  "rating": 4.9,
  "status": "Read",
  "progress": 100,
  "publisherId": 1,
  "formatId": 1,
  "authorIds": [1],
  "categoryIds": [1, 2]
}

### 12. Get Todos - Paginated List (Dapper Read)
GET {{bookism_HostAddress}}/api/todos?page=1&limit=10
Accept: application/json

### 13. Create Todo (EF Core Write)
POST {{bookism_HostAddress}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Membaca dokumentasi arsitektur Dapper dan EF Core"
}

### 14. Logout (Evict session cache users:{id})
POST {{bookism_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Accept: application/json
